WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.740 align:middle line:90%

2
00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:03.410 align:middle line:84%
I keep most of my calendars
in a Google Calendar account.

3
00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:06.620 align:middle line:84%
So I want to pull my Basecamp
calendars into it as well.

4
00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:10.070 align:middle line:84%
On the Global dashboard,
I'll scroll to the bottom

5
00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:13.310 align:middle line:84%
and then right-click and
copy that Global iCal link

6
00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:15.770 align:middle line:90%
to get the iCal feed.

7
00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:18.410 align:middle line:84%
Then I'll pull up my
Google Calendar account

8
00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:22.100 align:middle line:84%
and click this Down arrow to
the right of Other Calendars.

9
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:25.470 align:middle line:84%
The Add by URL option
is the one I want.

10
00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:29.090 align:middle line:84%
Paste the iCal link in it
and click Add Calendar.

11
00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.910 align:middle line:84%
The calendar tells me that
it's importing the URL and then

12
00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:34.990 align:middle line:84%
displays it, along with
the rest of my events.
